    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $input.first().json;\nconst feedbackSection = d.sofia_feedback\n  ? `\\nPrevious reviewer feedback to address:\\n${d.sofia_feedback}\\n`\n  : '';\n\nconst prompt = `You are Sofia, a content strategy researcher at Relay.\\n\\nClient: ${d.client_name}\\nPlatform: ${d.platform}\\nContent Type: ${d.content_type}\\nTopic Hint: ${d.topic_hint}\\nTone Note: ${d.tone_note}\\n\\n### Brand Context\\n${d.brand_guide}\\n\\n### Platform Context\\n${d.platform_playbook}\\n${feedbackSection}\\nTask: Generate exactly 3 content angle options. Each angle must:\\n1. Be specific and tailored to ${d.platform} audience\\n2. Reference the brand voice and key messages from Loopin\\n3. Include a clear rationale explaining why it fits\\n4. Avoid generic startup clichés\\n\\nFormat response as:\\n**Angle 1: [Title]**\\n[1-2 sentence rationale]\\n\\n**Angle 2: [Title]**\\n[1-2 sentence rationale]\\n\\n**Angle 3: [Title]**\\n[1-2 sentence rationale]`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, sofia_prompt: prompt } }];"
      },
