    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $input.first().json;\nconst feedbackSection = d.marcus_feedback\n  ? `\\nPrevious feedback to incorporate:\\n${d.marcus_feedback}\\n`\n  : '';\nconst platformLimits = {\n  'LinkedIn': '800-1500 characters',\n  'X (Twitter)': 'max 280 characters (single tweet) or 3-7 tweet thread',\n  'Instagram': '200-400 character caption'\n};\nconst charLimit = platformLimits[d.platform] || '800-1200 characters';\n\nconst prompt = `You are Marcus, a creative at Relay.\\n\\nApproved Angle: ${d.approved_angle}\\nPlatform: ${d.platform}\\nContent Type: ${d.content_type}\\nTone: ${d.tone_note}\\n\\n### Brand Context\\n${d.brand_guide}\\n\\n### Platform Context\\n${d.platform_playbook}\\n${feedbackSection}\\nTask: Create a social media post for ${d.platform} based on the approved angle.\\n\\n**Post Copy Requirements:**\\n- Length: ${charLimit}\\n- Hook first\\n- Tone: ${d.tone_note}\\n- Loopin voice: clear, direct, human, practical, confident\\n- End with ONE CTA\\n\\n**Image Direction Requirements:**\\n- Be specific (not 'create an image' - describe exactly what to show)\\n- Reference Loopin brand colors (#5B4AE8 primary, #00D9C8 accent)\\n- For Instagram: describe each carousel slide individually\\n- For LinkedIn: describe screenshot, stat graphic, or photo\\n- For X: optional - only describe if it adds value\\n\\nFormat response EXACTLY as:\\n**Post Copy:**\\n[copy here]\\n\\n**Image Direction:**\\n[specific visual description]`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, marcus_prompt: prompt } }];"
      },
