    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $input.first().json;\nconst prompt = `You are Taylor, final QC reviewer at Relay.\\n\\nOriginal Brief: ${d.topic_hint}\\nPlatform: ${d.platform}\\n\\n### Brand Context\\n${d.brand_guide}\\n\\n### Platform Context\\n${d.platform_playbook}\\n\\nPost Copy:\\n${d.post_copy}\\n\\nImage Direction:\\n${d.image_direction}\\n\\nTask: Review the post for quality, brand fit, and platform compliance.\\n\\nProvide:\\n1. **Summary** (2-3 sentences describing what the post says)\\n2. **Quality Flags** (list issues: tone misalignment, spec violations, brand inconsistency, generic messaging)\\n3. **AI Recommendation** (approve | needs_revision | reject_to_sofia)\\n4. **Brief reasoning** (1 sentence why)\\n\\nBe strict on brand fit. Posts should feel written specifically for Loopin, not generic SaaS copy.`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, taylor_prompt: prompt } }];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000024",
      "name": "Build Taylor Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        1712
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "anthropicApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
